 X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 Laptop GPU - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-13900HX (32 threads) - 31.03 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\n> This is **irrelevant** to [issue#115999](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115999). After applying [PR#116000](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116000), the problem persists.\n\nWhen using threaded processing (set `process_thread_group` to sub) for a Node3D, reading its transform, specifically the basis part, would erroneously affect its transform.\n\nThat is, the operation of reading its basis could unexpectedly override its transform. Here's a video demonstrating this (The text in the video described the operations done in their respective `_physics_process()`, and their threading configurations):\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/36f3d3d4-683f-4fe8-8d21-8d5d9585b617\n\nNote that *any reading operations involving the basis* would cause this, not just `get_basis`, but also `get_transform`.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nRun the scene in the MRP.\n\nI made [PR#116012](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116012) to address this, technical explanation and break down is given in the PR.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[demo_threaded_tf_read.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25153197/demo_threaded_tf_read.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116011/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116011/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}